<title>JAPAN: Shimizu Bank -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Shimizu Bank -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	    21.60		vs	   27.34</p>
<p> Operating	    5.12		vs	    5.08</p>
<p> Current		3.75		vs	    4.05</p>
<p> Net		    1.93		vs	    2.11</p>
<p> EPS		  197.08 yen	  vs	  215.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	 25.00 yen	  vs	   25.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Shimizu Bank Ltd is a Shizuoka-based bank.</p>
